task (completed) {
  update news sources {source}

  Implemented:
  news_fetch.php
  - Added the `hackernews` source (https://news.ycombinator.com/rss) as a
    new RSS source, so every entry in {source} is now supported.
  - The Hacker News feed carries only the headline and a Comments link, so
    the source uses `full_article`, which fetches and caches the linked
    article page for the detail view (limit 10 stories).
  - Verified with `php news_fetch.php --json --source hackernews --limit 3`;
    stories stream with titles, dates, full paragraphs, and cover images.
  app/chat_server.py
  - Added hackernews to NEWS_SOURCES (tab completion, the /news source
    picker, and validation), the /news help text, and the command docstring.
}

